 ],
 "notes": "Sort key and SSE/alarm options are off under defaults, so they are checked via declared capabilities and parameter defaults; parameter names are not pinned. alarms_publish_to_sns tests that alarm actions are set, not that they name an SNS topic, because the ground truth publishes to an imported ARN with nothing SNS-specific in it. The interpreter has no test for an empty selection (exists.min must be at least 1), so alarms_optional can't assert that no alarm is instantiated; it requires gated alarms and an alarm or topic parameter defaulting to an off or blank value."
